      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To minimize small errors, focus on implementing structured pre-check routines for all tasks. Before submitting any report or heading to an appointment, create a quick checklist of critical steps to immediately catch those minor slip-ups. For timing, build in a small buffer before deadlines to account for unforeseen delays. This proactive system of double-checking will help prevent small issues from becoming noticeable flags.",
